OL,3,GNEWSASex was 'huge preoccupation for
OL,4,ARussell Brand', ex-flatmate tells trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FA former flatmate of Russell Brand has
OL,10,Ftold a jury that "sex was a huge
OL,11,Fpreoccupation" for the entertainer.
OL,13,FAndrew Dobson, who was in Bournemouth
OL,14,Fwhere Brand is alleged to have raped a
OL,15,Fwoman, has been giving evidence on the
OL,16,Ffourth day of the trial.
OL,18,FBrand, 51, faces seven charges in the
OL,19,Ftrial at Southwark Crown Court - three
OL,20,Fcounts of rape, three charges of sexual
OL,21,Fassault and one of indecent assault.
